{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"pass\":true,\"problems\":[\"S04-B4只被合理地“独立保留”，没有获得完整因果解释；尤其“运动本身只是为了避免停下来”这一回避动机，现有两条候选都没有说明为什么停下来会变得难以承受。不过它不是本段最核心的转折，因此不构成整段不合格。\"],\"unexplained\":[{\"id\":\"S04-B4\",\"why\":\"缺前提\",\"note\":\"H1、H3、H9已经足以支持旧疑问重新出现、反复自问，却不足以推出“不断思考是为了避免停下来”这一特定回避动机。若要解释后半句，需要前面已经建立“停下来会迫使他面对某个目前无法承受的东西”之类的前提；现有历史没有这一层。\"}],\"reason\":\"合格。S04-B1与本段最关键的92–115转折都得到具体因果解释：M42用“真实经历过的快乐已经不可原样重来”解释温暖为何转为舍不得和刺痛，M39用“已经知道熟悉的位置会离开”解释为何重新获得后反而急于守住、越加力越焦灼；它们依赖的H3、H6–H9都来自此前实际解释过的听感，没有另造外部事件。两条候选均保持原话，理由也不是空泛的“经历过所以不同”。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d4911287-3e61-4376-9a20-341af338d5d8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261027T222309159170Z", "elapsed_seconds": 28.14, "completed_utc": "2026-10-27T22:23:37.305810+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ee045440f25fc55de6a17ce1e39c4635c0ed436d60027f83c5bfa3364d56ef2c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa